 and distances to such reference points or monuments.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fee84ef1-aa59-50e2-9359-44a4d954913d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.200","content_hash":"11723079a8fbd89516b2dafc9a63b02f28f435537848e5d19cd439fd816da222","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.200:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.200","text":"(d) The location of lots, streets, public highways, alleys, parks and other features, with accurate dimensions in feet and decimals of feet, with the length of radii or area of all curves, and with all other information necessary to reproduce the plat on the ground; dimensions shall be shown from all angle points and points of curve to lot lines.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"5219bd41-9ab2-51e7-bab8-5e6ca860e5d2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.200","content_hash":"52e3582b35ab71a0e51728b4f58357593b156c53dd289e7b694d50671bdc5c4d","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.200:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.200","text":"(e) Lots shall be clearly designated by number or letter; the area of each lot shall be indicated in terms of square footage either in tabular form or within the lot boundaries on the plat.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"59ca9677-f380-5650-acf2-715b3486ff5c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.200","content_hash":"ce